      "uid": "zhcn:583b813f44928a2a07669bbc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次有可以称得上是劲敌的成员吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1743c0be863361c9356834cb02cc663cc92de842d92cf13395b1167392a0782",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:092ab7890472a64fd617c7b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有传闻说你会在休息室吃饭团？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ebe55341b5a818ce036aab0322bc9b3babfd37c6ad8c1a41580c5cd82b1cc13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "413"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91d8e9e03e69d1f3ffcd7d87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有必胜方法吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "940cc73da55ff87dda08f4da2909d0262690150d90dd1939346f535da4b08c1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "414"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d813069c86a11325c57ce3ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请以学生会长的身份对学园的大家说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b08f40d03e9fce9e2578080460aac2543759f7fb381016a6cbc5f1797327186",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7449da7076f38eeda663532",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛前的致胜料理吃了什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "977ce0c7615a51c57dff528bc9bedf1dc33650d36215b553d98df2851f2f32aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "416"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06636fd48ee0a8bc584e45a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次的竞赛，有令你感到不安的要素吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2e0363d1b0616fd641af78dd0e863d213e62d98f5f92ee99c243f3fd015654",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "417"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1851ffb8503d3c1e99f9d30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有做什么事祈求好运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e37f432d02ff939eccdce4da382f034142b2754134b534240d3a8a167a5a8b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf5e964a872619cf8d5b81b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "兼顾学生会与竞赛最让你感到辛苦的是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "342004631ee2aab7010600f120a9124cb1dc42ed6f86b0a08525b65e6fbbaf36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57e184d1e9b6cdc421641604",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有只鸟一直在你头上盘旋呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a43fc1d9d1985bb0eae7cedcdb0a453f6aa4c499b4b7015f84b04ce9cb8b0b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b082d48a596d69684379d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们不会紧张的诀窍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59732d13f75b8d0e7fc6f69c9885498df4f4e48c077afad712c87913d5ea4185",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72dcc088935d6de3736c596d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对于本次战场的局势，你有何看法？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f5d82d980377ff277a0274f03b13bde173f184012a5666000c7c1989f168d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:273753a75db63624ec18c09b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在今天的竞赛当中，你最关注谁呢？",
